                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <a href="#thirteen">13. HOW CAN YOU CONTACT US ABOUT THIS NOTICE?</a></li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <a href="#fourteen">14. HOW CAN YOU REVIEW, UPDATE OR DELETE THE DATA WE COLLECT FROM YOU?</a></li>

